  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut zucchini into half-moons. Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place zucchini, potato and peeled & chopped pumpkin on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66862c6d8e8ca7af41fae555-021f17f8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, rinse and drain white rice. In a medium saucepan, bring the water (for the rice) to boil.\n• Add white rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce the heat to low. Cook for 10 mins. Remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66862c6d8e8ca7af41fae555-fc2f98f3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 5 mins remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat.\n• Add sweet Asian spice blend, katsu paste, coconut milk, the vinegar and water(for the curry) and cook, stirring to combine, until slightly reduced, 2-3 mins.\n• Add roasted veggies and baby spinach, gently stirring to combine. Cook for 1 min. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66862c6d8e8ca7af41fae555-093c8f8d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir the butter through the rice. Season.\n• Divide rice and veggie-loaded Japanese coconut curry between bowls. Sprinkle with crispy shallots to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66862c6d8e8ca7af41fae555-bd34014a.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
